      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You can't fix what you can't see. The damage is already done, and there's no going back. It's better to just let it all go and move on. You don't have to be the person they always thought you were. Maybe it's time to start fresh, without the weight of expectations and the fear of disappointing them. You might find a new path, one where you can be happy without the burden of being perfect. Sometimes, letting go is the only way to find peace.",
